       the wall or a previously placed same-color sprite. Verify no cross-color
       pixel overlap; reject/retry on collision.
    5. Derive INPUT by shifting each sprite horizontally away from its wall by a
       random offset (1-5 cols), clamping to stay within cols 1..W-2. Verify no
